Abstract = {This article aims to reflect on communication practiced by organizations
   in the contemporary world, globalized, with the knowledge and
   communication are quickly shared by technologies available. Works to the
   existing theoretical framework in the field of organizational
   communication, briefly considering its history and development,
   reflecting on the relevance of internal and external communication and
   use of technology, the Internet social networks as well as the
   challenges involved fronts to emotions and emotions present in the
   virtual environment and its relationship with the organization. Support
   the exploratory quantitative research and theoretical reference based on
   recognized authors in the areas addressed.},
